  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "桌面上的每个玩具槽位都是构筑决策，要组合稀有单位并调整阵形释放完整Build潜力",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Master the art of toy arrangement on your tabletop! Every toy slot is a strategic decision. Plan your layout, combine rare units, and arrange them wisely to unlock your build’s full potential!",
